OL,3,ABurnham to hold security talks with
OL,4,AGerman chancellor in Berlin
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Berlin talks come days after
OL,7,FBurnham told the Labour Party's
OL,8,Fconference he wanted to set out options
OL,9,Ffor a closer relationship with the EU
OL,10,Flater this year, including the prospect
OL,11,Fof eventually rejoining the bloc.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
