OL,3,AUK bluefin tuna comeback shows nature
OL,4,Acan recover, says WWF
OL,5,
OL,6,FBluefin tuna have returned in huge
OL,7,Fnumbers off the British coast after
OL,8,Falmost disappearing from UK waters.
OL,10,FThe return of the giant predatory fish
OL,11,Fis one of several wildlife recoveries
OL,12,Fhighlighted in a major new report from
OL,13,FWWF, which it says shows conservation
OL,14,Fcan work.
OL,16,FHowever, the Living Planet Report 2026
OL,17,Falso found that monitored wildlife
OL,18,Fpopulations around the world have
OL,19,Ffallen by an average of 73% since 1970.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
