OL,3,ASpanish pensioner whose eviction
OL,4,Asparked nationwide protests dies
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We regret to announce that Maricarmen
OL,7,Fpassed away today," the Madrid Tenants'
OL,8,FUnion said in a statement, adding her
OL,9,Fsituation marked "a turning point in
OL,10,Fthe history of this country".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
