OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMargaret Hamilton, whose software
OL,4,Ahelped land Apollo 11 on the Moon, dies
OL,5,Aat 90
OL,6,
OL,7,F"To say Hamilton was a pioneer - to say
OL,8,Fshe was ahead of her time - would be a
OL,9,Fdramatic understatement," MIT said in
OL,10,Fits statement, before acknowledging
OL,11,Fthat she was a software engineer before
OL,12,Fit was mainstream.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
